OL,3,GNEWSATeen to win award for helping
OL,4,Adisabled youngsters
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Kent schoolboy who has a rare spinal
OL,7,Fcondition is set to be honoured with a
OL,8,Fnational award for his efforts to
OL,9,Fimprove the lives of other disabled
OL,10,Fchildren.
OL,12,FGeorge, 15, champions greater inclusion
OL,13,Fand accessibility, has spoken in the
OL,14,FHouse of Commons and even helped shape
OL,15,FNHS decision-making.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
