OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSATeen to win award for helping
OL,4,Adisabled youngsters
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Tunbridge Wells teenager, who has
OL,7,Fspinal muscular atrophy (SMA) Type 2,
OL,8,Fsaid: "The disabled community in 2026
OL,9,Fis still fighting for basic human
OL,10,Frights and I don't want the next
OL,11,Fgeneration having to fight the same
OL,12,Fbattles. No good ever came from doing
OL,13,Fnothing."
OL,15,FGeorge is due to pick up a Special
OL,16,FRecognition Award at the WellChild
OL,17,FAwards on Monday and meet Prince Harry
OL,18,Fat the event.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
